rits and numerous secrets on your way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737870/extras/f1db3f8d643412f74168690db6a0e534.poster.avif?t=1761757648\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737870/extras/f1db3f8d643412f74168690db6a0e534.webm?t=1761757648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737870/extras/f1db3f8d643412f74168690db6a0e534.mp4?t=1761757648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every journey begins from nothing \u2013 become Reka and begin yours.<br><br>\ud83d\udeaa   Construct, bewitch and journey with your very own witch home!<br>\ud83e\ude91   Decorate and create your own haven with ultimate placement freedom.<br>\ud83c\udf42  Forge your path through breath-taking, procedurally generated, natural landscapes.<br>\ud83d\udc08  Discover and tame wildlife to join you on your adventure, or bring them home!<br>\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f  Discover settlements, accept quests, and decide whether to help or hinder local villagers.<br>\ud83e\uddd9\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u2640\ufe0f  Create your own witch with fully customisable character creation tools.","developers":["Emberstorm Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737870/header.jpg?t=1761757648","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"REKA \u00a9 2023. Emberstorm Entertainment UG. Developed by Emberstorm Entertainment UG. Published by Sold Out Sales & Marketing Ltd. trading as Fireshine Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steam